    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey of exploration and self-discovery in this immersive mining adventure. You play as a determined miner from a unique species, whose dream is to reach the moon. To make this dream a reality, you must mine valuable materials to build your spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll be accompanied by <strong>Astra</strong>, the AI embedded in your suit. Astra provides guidance, support, and commentary as you navigate the treacherous depths, helping you upgrade your mining gear and survive the challenges of the underground. Together, you'll forge a path toward the stars, but as you progress, the weight of ambition may begin to feel heavier than expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your mining gear, from sturdy armor to powerful pickaxes, to survive the dangers lurking beneath the surface. Explore vast, procedurally generated underground landscapes, filled with unique materials, dangerous creatures, and hidden secrets. Each upgrade and discovery brings you closer to your ultimate goal \u2014 reaching the moon. But will achieving your dream bring true fulfillment, or will the journey leave you questioning everything you've worked for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to mine your way to the top? Or will the weight of your ambitions change everything you thought you knew?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey of exploration and self-discovery in this immersive mining adventure. You play as a determined miner from a unique species, whose dream is to reach the moon. To make this dream a reality, you must mine valuable materials to build your spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll be accompanied by <strong>Astra</strong>, the AI embedded in your suit. Astra provides guidance, support, and commentary as you navigate the treacherous depths, helping you upgrade your mining gear and survive the challenges of the underground. Together, you'll forge a path toward the stars, but as you progress, the weight of ambition may begin to feel heavier than expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your mining gear, from sturdy armor to powerful pickaxes, to survive the dangers lurking beneath the surface. Explore vast, procedurally generated underground landscapes, filled with unique materials, dangerous creatures, and hidden secrets. Each upgrade and discovery brings you closer to your ultimate goal \u2014 reaching the moon. But will achieving your dream bring true fulfillment, or will the journey leave you questioning everything you've worked for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to mine your way to the top? Or will the weight of your ambitions change everything you thought you knew?</p>",
    "short_description": "Mine, upgrade, and explore as you journey toward the moon. With the help of Astra, the AI in your suit, gather resources, build your ship, and face the emotional cost of chasing your dreams. Will reaching the top bring you happiness, or leave you questioning everything?",
